OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after boy, 15, stabbed in
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fifteen-year-old boy has been taken
OL,7,Fto hospital after allegedly being
OL,8,Fstabbed by another teenager.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to Slad
OL,11,FRoad in Stroud, Gloucestershire, at
OL,12,Fabout 19:25 BST on Saturday to reports
OL,13,Fof an incident in a nearby park.
OL,15,FThe teenage victim was taken to
OL,16,FGloucestershire Royal Hospital for
OL,17,Ftreatment to injuries that are not
OL,18,Fbelieved to be serious.
